<title>SINGAPORE: Goodwood 1996 net profit up 15.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Goodwood 1996 net profit up 15.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months ended September 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of Singapore dollars unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		     36.42  vs  31.53</p>
<p>    Group shares (cents)	 81.00  vs  70.00</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)	     55.00  vs  55.00</p>
<p>    Turnover			260.89  vs 204.19</p>
<p>    Investment income	   123.33  vs  84.19</p>
<p>    Interest income		 0.63  vs   0.04</p>
<p>    Pretax			   57.88  vs  52.93</p>
<p>    Tax				15.11  vs  15.54</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (6.36) vs  (5.86)</p>
<p>Div pay/register - January 9 1997, 27 December 1996.</p>
<p>Note - Full name is Goodwood Park Hotel Ltd.</p>
<p>- Singapore Newsroom 65-8703080</p>
